### FINAL DEFINITION OF DONE

SCHLAR must provide two distinct and usable workspaces. An authorized Accountant / Fee Manager can manage permitted fee and finance workflows with consistent records and accurate totals. An authorized HR / Staff Manager can manage permitted staff and HR workflows with detailed records and appropriate privacy boundaries.

Both workspaces must use the established SCHLAR design system, ChatGPT-inspired sidebar navigation, shared demo data, validated forms, clear feedback, and role-based access. Existing functionality must remain intact, and no real backend or external service may be falsely claimed.